# The app update downloads GitHub's archive of main. Nothing under media/
# (films, audio, renders) belongs in that download, even if files are added
# there again later.
/media export-ignore
# Release test plans and reports are for reviewing a pull request on GitHub.
# They were three quarters of the download and a third of the files every
# update extracted, and the running app never reads them.
/docs/testing export-ignore
